From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:53:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] GBA auto-reset: raise the cooldown floor past the official
 BIOS boot time

The cooldown must exceed the slowest reset->link-window-open time, or a
probe landing after the cooldown but before Emerald's window opens resets
the core again and the window is never reached. Measured cycle-accurate:
the bundled open-source BIOS reaches the window 2.35 s after reset, the
official BIOS 4.78 s -- past the old 4 s floor, which made linking with a
configured official BIOS probabilistic (it only worked when XD's probe
cadence happened to leave a gap). 6 s clears the worst case with 1.2 s of
margin. Steady-state reset cadence is unaffected: the window_just_closed
edge drives it; the cooldown is only the bootstrap/missed-edge recovery.
---
 Source/Core/Core/HW/SI/SI_DeviceGBAEmu.cpp | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Source/Core/Core/HW/SI/SI_DeviceGBAEmu.cpp b/Source/Core/Core/HW/SI/SI_DeviceGBAEmu.cpp
index 927ff1d..2f79ac4 100644
--- a/Source/Core/Core/HW/SI/SI_DeviceGBAEmu.cpp
+++ b/Source/Core/Core/HW/SI/SI_DeviceGBAEmu.cpp
@@ -122,7 +122,13 @@ int CSIDevice_GBAEmu::RunBuffer(u8* buffer, int request_length)
         m_last_data_cmd != 0 && (m_timestamp_sent - m_last_data_cmd) < tps * 8;
     if (probing && !link_now && !handshake_active && !m_link_established)
     {
-      const u64 min_interval = tps * 4;
+      // Must exceed the slowest reset->link-window-open time or the cooldown
+      // resets the core before Emerald's window ever opens (livelock).
+      // Measured: bundled open-source BIOS 2.35 s, official BIOS 4.78 s --
+      // 6 s clears the worst case with margin. Steady-state reset cadence is
+      // driven by the window_just_closed edge, so this only affects the
+      // bootstrap/missed-edge recovery path.
+      const u64 min_interval = tps * 6;
       const bool window_just_closed = m_link_was_enabled;
       const bool cooldown_elapsed =
           m_last_auto_reset == 0 || m_timestamp_sent - m_last_auto_reset > min_interval;
